# 15. The core final design

The full system is:

```txt
Essay
→ rhythm analysis
→ mythos-filtered storyboard
→ glossary/concept matching
→ still or motion asset selection
→ video render timeline
→ mp4
→ video DNA
→ YouTube retention mapping
→ frame-level performance
→ creative insight
→ better future storyboard
```

The magic is not just automation.

The magic is that every video becomes an experiment in:

```txt
Which ideas,
under which symbolic images,
at which rhythm,
with which mythic style,
held attention?
```

That is the product.

